  {
   "id": 1,
   "parent": 0,
   "text": "I heard the swimming pool is officially condemned for the entire summer due to a major toxic contamination. It sounds like the water is completely unsafe and the situation is much worse than they are letting on.",
   "author": 18,
   "step": 1,
   "mutation": "exaggerate",
   "emotion": 3.64,
   "extremity": 3.92
  },
  {
   "id": 2,
   "parent": 0,
   "text": "The municipal pool is being shut down indefinitely because the water is officially considered a toxic health hazard. I knew this facility had been falling apart for years, and now it’s finally become too dangerous for anyone to step foot in.",
   "author": 58,
   "step": 1,
   "mutation": "exaggerate",
   "emotion": 1.26,
   "extremity": 3.3
  },
  {
   "id": 3,
   "parent": 1,
   "text": "The pool is officially a toxic hazard zone and will be completely off-limits all summer. It’s way worse than they’re saying, so don't even think about stepping foot near that contaminated water!",
   "author": 25,
   "step": 2,
   "mutation": "exaggerate",
   "emotion": 3.98,
   "extremity": 3.98
  },
  {
   "id": 4,
   "parent": 2,
   "text": "I just heard the municipal pool is shutting down indefinitely because the water is officially a toxic health hazard. Apparently, Mrs. Gable saw them dumping strange chemicals into the pool at 3:00 AM last Tuesday!",
   "author": 50,
   "step": 2,
   "mutation": "add_detail",
   "emotion": 3.464646464646465,
   "extremity": 3.5252525252525255
  },
  {
   "id": 5,
   "parent": 0,
   "text": "The municipal pool is being shut down indefinitely because the water is officially considered toxic and unsafe for any residents. Don't even think about going near there, as this is a massive health crisis that they’re trying to keep quiet.",
