   "step": 2,
   "mutation": "exaggerate",
   "emotion": 3.98,
   "extremity": 3.91
  },
  {
   "id": 6,
   "parent": 3,
   "text": "I’ve been hearing rumors that the pool might have some maintenance issues and could be closed for the summer. It’s hard to know what to believe, but you might want to be cautious if you were planning on heading over there.",
